01:17:08,571 --> 01:17:14,571
Christy is a 2025 American biographical sports drama film directed by David Michôd, written by Michôd and Mirrah
Foulkes, and starring Sydney Sweeney, Ben Foster, Merritt Wever, Katy O'Brian, Ethan Embry, and Chad L.

13
01:23:34,285 --> 01:23:40,285
The film chronicles the rise of former professional boxer Christy Martin (Sweeney) to becoming America's
best-known female boxer in the 1990s, and later her coach-turned-husband's 2010 attempted murder of her.

14
01:30:00,000 --> 01:30:06,000
The film had its world premiere at the 2025 Toronto International Film
Festival on September 5, 2025, in the Special Presentations section.

15
01:36:25,714 --> 01:36:31,714
It was released theatrically on November 7, 2025, by Black Bear Pictures, earning $1.3 million in its opening weekend in the United States,
which Box Office Mojo classified as one of the top 12 worst openings for a new release that opened on over 2,000 screens.

16
01:42:51,428 --> 01:42:57,428
